      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ingram%2C_Wisconsin"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Early steam engines required frequent stops, leading to the creation of the Ingram station in 1884.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        5,
        10
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ingram%2C_Wisconsin"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The settlement of Ingram was officially surveyed and platted in September 1888.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        11
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ingram%2C_Wisconsin"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "A large stream saw mill was built in Ingram by F. Turcot before being sold to the French Lumbering Company.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        12,
